{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/248261-player-looking-for-online-game","id":248261,"title":"Player looking for online game!!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-03T17:14:01-07:00","id":248261,"title":"Player looking for online game!!","content":"Hello C:tD board! I've lurked around and dropped a few comments here but haven't been to active in the nWoD online community. Up until recently I've had my core group of guys to play with but unfortunately that recently changed. Before I dive into the matter allow me to apologize for not fishing around and begging to join a game, but I'm new to the online roleplaying scene and decided I'd cast one big hook for a game (or twelve) invite than twenty little ones.<br /> <br /> Anyway I'm Lou, Mr Silvers if your formal. I've been playing nWoD since the V:tR release and storytelling Changeling since it's release. I'm here today to fish out some online games to get my toes wet and get my fix. I recently took custody of my three year old and can't get out to game like I once did. I can't really have my core guys over anymore either because well in my opinion nWoD isn't particularly toddler friendly. I'll leave her with her ideas of tinkerbell fairies than putting Kindly ones into her head. As far as my nWoD experience goes I'm intimately familiar with Vampire, Promethian, Hunter, and of course Changeling. My Werewolf is okay, but I like the feel of Apocolypse better than Forsaken (rare case that I prefer oWoD). I haven't spent much time with Mage, Mummy, or Giest and my Demon isn't quite committed to memory. Sue me I wanted to wait for my prestige copy before I dove in.<br /> <br /> I'd prefer to play a Changeling game since it resonates with the surrealism and stress I'm feeling from my recent lifestyle changes, however I'm game for any nWoD game just to quench my nWoD thirst (and sweet cheeks I'm thirsty). So please please please get a hold of me if your in need of a fresh Lost in one of your campaigns. I'd love to hop in and get some game on. Feel free to send me a private message with details or leave a post here (i'll be lurking with baited breath). I can have a character to you within a day, I have quite a few brewing in the ol' noggin. Thanks in advance and take care.<br /> <br /> -Lou","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2681-lousilvers","name":"LouSilvers","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T19:52:51-07:00","id":265901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/img/ww_logo_50x50.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Wanton Wicked an Online World of Darkness Roleplaying Game </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/wiki/index.php?n=Changeling.Changeling\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/img/ww_logo_50x50.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/wiki/index.php